Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 14:04:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: bank-primary payday recoupment model

- Update employer settings UI to surface bank_name + masked bank_account as primary
- Move mobile money fields below as fallback (only used if recoupment_method=mobile_money or bank fails)
- Update admin payday recoupments page copy to reflect bank as primary, mobile money as fallback
- Add recoupment_method field to payday_recoupments creation and tracking
- Update notifications to show preferred recoupment method
- Add comprehensive documentation for future automated bank collection (pending Stanbic confirmation)

Current behavior: Manual-confirm flow for both bank and mobile money, with bank as preferred default.
Future: Automated bank collection via Stanbic once direct debit/standing order support is confirmed.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
